<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-03T17:58:01.363Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:58:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drone strikes have intensified, targeting Sudan's power system in the east and causing widespread outages, while the Sudanese army has shot down an FH-95 drone over West Kordofan. Sudan has filed formal complaints against Ethiopia at the UN Security Council and the African Union over cross-border drone attacks. Displaced civilians returning to Khartoum and Darfur face new challenges, including famine risk in Kalma camp and survivors pledging to document killings after recent camp attacks. The conflict resulted in 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOWHJpbk9MTVE3MVZqdFlWeDVFblV2V1dZZWxlQzNpX1FxY3JpVDA4SDdENGY0N0tvcWlLTUsxQjFEczF2NVBMczdEdDdQNTFZNU4tUlJya3VBS1otM0VadnJGVXVSVTJzWTVpeVIyWmJKdzVJRXhoUlVfeEZSUG5waHp0eER1c1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxONzRGVHdVb1U0ckxCRUZwZW5MX1hyZExrU0RwbFV3SEZfRVlzQ3dQRmJ2NFpiMEVHNFNfU1pXSlR0aEhPWkdlMGlMY0YxalNxNG4yeERHME9qWmJUc1hkVDJobVl1SHVsX3NlS1N6YWtHWnVqejdCQzNpOEZQMkotWWQxTkJIaHU0YWxhdmQ5aWhlSWFPNnd5RnZzZU83Q1VZa29udXdzbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
